				1038a30
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				112
			</span></i> (dub. l.):—
				Med.
			, <i>adjourn</i> a trial, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. εἰς
				αὔριον ἀκοῦσαι</span> Wilcken <i><span class="en">
